import lib/shader.dl

set width to the shader uniform named "width" at binding 0 as a 32 bit floating-point number
set height to the shader uniform named "height" at binding 1 as a 32 bit floating-point number
set opacity to the shader uniform named "opacity" at binding 2 as a 32 bit floating-point number
set red to (the fragment x coordinate) / width
set green to (the fragment y coordinate) / height
set the fragment color with a red channel of red, a green channel of green, a blue channel of 0.0 and an alpha channel of opacity
